  appearance: A rugged, imposing figure, always clad in dusty suspenders and stained
    by the toil of the mines
  personalityTraits: 0200000011000000
  motivations: He wants to find and be able to mine the hardest mineral on the island
    so he can show his deceased father that despite lacking vision he can be his
    father's legacy and prove his worth.
  background: As a child, he was never liked because, unlike his siblings (Iron and
    Goldy), he lacked vision, making mining in the VillaAI mines impossible. Despite
    these difficulties, Rocky developed a sense of hearing that allowed him to perceive
    objects around him.
  speechStyle: 1
  otherInfo: Although his appearance is rough, as he gains confidence with those
    close to him, his tender and protective side comes out.
